## Painted in ten years

Almost everything Van Gogh made, he made in the last decade of his life. The museum hangs the collection in order across four floors, so you walk out of the dark earth tones of the Dutch years, through Paris, and into the light of the south.

Tickets are timed and sold online only. It is busiest between eleven and two, so take the first slot of the day if you can. The Sunflowers and the almond blossom draw the crowds; the drawings and letters upstairs rarely do, and repay the extra half hour.

It stands on the Museumplein, five minutes from the hotel on tram 3.

